fficially in the semifinals, with the remaining quarterfinals still pending. One version still listed Spain/Belgium as unresolved.\n- **Schedule:** The semifinals were set for Tuesday, July 14 and Wednesday, July 15, with France vs. Spain at Dallas Stadium in the earlier listings.\n\nSince it's now October 2026, the tournament should be over. The NBC Sports recap headlines are the best evidence here, but I'd check a dedicated results source such as FIFA's official site before relying on them.\n\n\nREMINDER: You MUST include the sources above in your response to the user using markdown hyperlinks."}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"d92a4741-1cee-4118-951e-a09160f07312","uuid":"509b6cb6-4c92-4577-9e2d-cc63eeb24fc1","timestamp":"2026-10-17T02:34:57.386Z","tool_use_result":{"query":"2026 FIFA World Cup semifinals teams","results":[{"tool_use_id":"srvtoolu_01WbQuB7X4jXkgUuNTLACkng","content":[{"title":"when are the 2026 fifa world cup semifinals dates confirmed teams","url":"https://www.nbcsports.com/soccer/news/when-are-the-2026-fifa-world-cup-semifinals-dates-confirmed-teams"},{"title":"2026 World Cup","url":"https://www.nbcsandiego.com/world-cup/semifinals-bracket-teams-schedule-2026"},{"title":"2026 World Cup","url":"https://www.nbcwashington.com/world-cup/semifinals-bracket-teams-schedule-2026"},{"title":"2026 World Cup","url":"https://www.nbclosangeles.com/world-cup/semifinals-bracket-teams-schedule-2026"},{"title":"2026 World Cup","url":"https://www.nbcconnecticut.com/world-cup/semifinals-bracket-teams-schedule-2026"},{"title":"2026 World Cup","url":"https://www.nbcbayarea.com/world-cup/semifinals-bracket-teams-schedule-2026"},{"title":"2026 World Cup","url":"https://www.nbcbayarea.com/world-cup/semifinals-bracket-teams-schedule-2026/4111575/?amp=1"},{"title":"2026 World Cup","url":"https://www.nbcchicago.com/world-cup/semifinals-bracket-teams-schedule-2026"},{"title":"2026 World Cup","url":"https://www.nbcmiami.com/world-cup/semifinals-bracket-teams-sche